{"candidateAnswer":"Swimming, cycling, and martial arts.","evidence":"[D8:5 | 4:29 pm on 21 August, 2023] John: Thanks! Took some trial and error but I figured out a schedule with both basketball stuff and strength training to balance it out. Listening to my body and giving it enough rest made it easier to push myself during practice but also look after me. Here's my workout plan. It helps a lot with staying on track.\n[D20:2 | 9:52 am on 1 December, 2023] John: Hi Tim! Congrats on your success! Keep it up, you're doing great! I'm also trying out yoga to get a little extra strength and flexibility. It's challenging but worth it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:3fe521dd-b0ae-5797-9fec-d6a1999d0450","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6b560e5c73be41023497f74cf46c5fcffca95c4fc4d7c28f9a2db810b6dccaa8","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What other exercises can help John with his basketball performance?","referenceAnswer":"Sprinting, long-distance running, and boxing.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6b560e5c73be41023497f74cf46c5fcffca95c4fc4d7c28f9a2db810b6dccaa8"}}]}